# The Vault - James Burchill

The Vault is the online content library of James Burchill, Business Systems Architect, CTO, and bestselling author.

The library shares practical knowledge, essays, field notes, and resources across business, technology, AI, systems architecture, publishing, and teaching. Because Drift Happens is a recurring doctrine that informs James’s systems work and Driftinel, a drift detection system in development. Governing intelligent systems remains a deeper technical theme within this broader collection.

